Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 21:00:53 +0800
Subject: Output configuration follows the Android display (resolution,
 refresh policy, scale)

User output changes on the flat output go to the host through android-display-client
(MotoDisplay::request); modes and the current mode come from the host's display info.

Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-09-26
X-Rungic-Status: Inappropriate [Android host specific: runs nested in the Android APK compositor]
